{"type":"step-attempt","step":"code-review","sessionId":"a0aed8f6-a6bc-417f-bbd4-aee43863dcd4","outcome":{"verdict":"needs-fix","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/exclusion-aware-publish-prediction/review-feedback-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":false,"findings":[{"severity":"high","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/step/__tests__/exclusion-aware-validation.test.ts","title":"TC-003 (must) unit test missing — validateStepOutputs with excludeWorktreePatterns","rationale":"tasks.md T-12 marks [x] for 'Layer 1 validateStepOutputs のテスト' (TC-003) and the acceptance criterion requires 'Layer 1（validateStepOutputs）が unpushable-path violation を報告しない (unit test で固定)'. However the test file covers only TC-009, TC-010, TC-017–TC-021; no describe block for TC-003 exists in any test file. The implementation wiring (step-context-builder.ts → local.ts L1621 → collectPublishablePaths) is correct but untested as a chain."},{"severity":"high","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/step/__tests__/commit-push-exclusion.test.ts","title":"TC-008 (must, integration) missing — E2E guarded→scoped→complete story not automated","rationale":"test-cases.md lists TC-008 as category 'integration', priority 'must', and counts it in automated: 26. No test file contains a TC-008 describe block. Individual components are tested (TC-001 for guarded unpushable, TC-005 for scoped residual, TC-024 for reconcile), but the end-to-end sequence — guarded commitAndPush succeeds → excluded file remains in worktree → subsequent scoped commitAndPush also succeeds without WRITE_SCOPE_VIOLATION — has no automated test."},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/step/__tests__/commit-push-exclusion.test.ts","title":"TC-015, TC-016 (should) backward compat tests absent — counted in automated:26 but missing","rationale":"test-cases.md automated:26 tally includes TC-015 (commitScopedPaths backward compat: 7-arg call) and TC-016 (validateStepOutputs backward compat: 3-arg call). Neither describe block exists in any test file. These are 'should' priority but contribute to the stated automated count."}],"evidence":{"checked":29,"skipped":0,"unverified":2},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/git/push-capability.ts","title":"DSM constraint satisfied — no staging-containment import","rationale":"push-capability.ts imports only SpawnFn from util/spawn.js and matchesGlob from util/glob-match.js. No reference to staging-containment.ts. TC-028 is satisfied."},{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/step/commit-push.ts","title":"worktree/commit separation logic is correct","rationale":"collectPublishablePaths applies worktreeExcludePatterns to the paths Set immediately after section (a) git-status parsing and before section (b) rev-list addition. Committed paths are not filtered. TC-012/TC-013 cover this correctly."},{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/step/commit-push.ts","title":"Protected canon invariant maintained in scoped residual check","rationale":"filteredResidualPaths (exclusion applied) is passed to findScopedCommitViolations; postStatus.stagedOnly (unfiltered) is passed to findWriteScopeViolations. Exclusion cannot bypass scope enforcement over canon paths. TC-007 tests this."},{"severity":"low","file":"docs/configuration.md","title":"docs/configuration.md correctly updated with two-layer contract","rationale":"stagingExcludePatterns section at L412–444 documents staging behavior = guarded only and delivery scope enforcement = pipeline-wide. Table row updated. maxStagedFiles/maxStagedBytes rows retain 'Guarded steps only' unchanged."}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-29T05:21:19.944Z","endedAt":"2026-08-29T05:29:09.237Z","commitOid":"ddfc229797a416f3311d3634774e402e2a552b9d"}
